      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-01-2020-october/q8",
      "question": "<p>A new smartphone was released by a company.</p><p>The company monitored the total number of phones sold, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\"></span>, at time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> days after the phone was released.</p><p>The company observed that, during this time,</p><p>the rate of increase of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\"></span> was proportional to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\"></span></p><p>Use this information to write down a suitable equation for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\"></span> in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span>.</p><p>(<em>You do not need to evaluate any unknown constants in your equation.</em>) <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p>",
