      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-01-2020-october/q12",
      "question": "<p><strong>In this question you must show all stages of your working.</strong></p><p><strong>Solutions relying entirely on calculator technology are not acceptable.</strong></p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Show that<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\operatorname{cosec}\\theta-\\sin\\theta\\equiv\\cos\\theta\\cot\\theta\\qquad\\theta\\neq(180n)^\\circ\\quad n\\in\\mathbb Z\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li>Hence, or otherwise, solve for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0&lt;x&lt;180^\\circ\"></span><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\operatorname{cosec}x-\\sin x=\\cos x\\cot\\left(3x-50^\\circ\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></li></ol>",
      "steps": [
